    "updated_at": "2019-01-14T23:25:46Z",
    "body": "Ah, I was adding the listener too early.  DOMContentLoaded _is_ fired, but sync under close(), looks like?  At least in Chrome and Safari.\r\n\r\nFor the similar testcase when the document is in an iframe, both Chrome and Safari synchronously transition to \"complete\" when close() is called, fwiw.  Firefox seems to be the only one doing sort of what the spec says in that case.",
